Health is an attribute of your character that, funnily enough, indicates you healthy you are; more specifically, how much damage you can take.
When you attack something, you cause some damage. When it attacks you in return, you will take damage and lose some health. When you run out of health, you die.
Wetwiring will usually take care of restoring health, though there are some additional class abilities and mods that will hasten the process.
The maximum amount of health you have ranges from approximately 20-1000, depending on your level, your equipment, and your lifeforce.